#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Standalone certificate for K_G^C > 7/5.

Run: python3 check_complex_lower.py [--workers 1..4]
Requires Python 3.9+ standard library and g++ with C++17 support.
Do not run with -O. No optimizer, downloads, or external data are needed.
The accompanying PDF proves the analytic reductions and moment lemma.
This script regenerates all enclosed Gaussian integrals, checks the matrix
and global polynomial inequalities, covers every moment rectangle, then
checks ten rational intervals using nine unmixed quadratic bounds.
"""
